msgid "SiK Telemetry Radio"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:7
#: e15ffa9e6a9a4bafa98d2fd9312263f2
msgid "A *SiK Telemetry Radio* is one of the easiest ways to setup a telemetry connection between your Autopilot and a ground station. This article provides a basic user guide for how to connect and configure your radio."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:14
#: 5c37a7c68a034e66ada532f3f60687d6
msgid "3DR Radio v2 (a consumer implementation of SiKRadio)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:18
#: 1eedf512b3af4db7b5dcc3606465774b
msgid "This page was previously named *3DR Radio (version 2)* for 3DRobotics' trusted high quality implementation of SiK radio. As this radio is no longer available from 3DR, the page has been renamed to reflect the underlying open source radio platform."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:24
#: 0e8abfdb118940b08b31ed21382d7381
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:26
#: b3e2c416c081468f8fdb246e13ea65c8
msgid "A `SiK Telemetry Radio <https://github.com/ArduPilot/SiK>`__ is a small, light and inexpensive open source radio platform that typically allows ranges of better than 300m \"out of the box\" (the range can be extended to several kilometres with the use of a patch antenna on the ground). The radio uses `open source firmware <https://github.com/ArduPilot/SiK>`__ which has been specially designed to work well with MAVLink packets and to be integrated with the Mission Planner, Copter, Rover and Plane."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:34
#: 84e619d04fbe4d7f98ecfbbb414982f2
msgid "The radios can be either 915Mhz or 433Mhz and you should purchase the model which is :ref:`appropriate for your country/region <common-telemetry-radio-regional-regulations>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:37
#: 370f60672bcd46f0bb90d38884bfc5e1
msgid "As the platform is open source, implementation can be purchased from many different sources, including ArduPilot Partners:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:40
#: 9577685102104c9cbc58519e6893fdf2
msgid "Search EBay for `SiK Telemetry Radio <https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_from=R40&_trksid=m570.l1313&_nkw=SiK+telemetry+radio&_sacat=0&LH_TitleDesc=0&_osacat=0&_odkw=3dr+telemetry+radio>`__ (be aware, many \"clones\" have incorrect analog modules and will interoperate fine with themselves, although with reduced range, but not with the original \"3DR\" design. OEM versions below do not have this issue)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:41
#: a255faf27d604950bfb036f85dfcf9f4
msgid "`TFSIK01 Telemetry Radio <https://docs.thunderfly.cz/avionics/TFSIK01/>`__ (ThunderFly)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:42
#: 9a6f98d7b1c94b7fad9a20848c09cf54
msgid "`mRo SiK Telemetry Radio <https://store.mrobotics.io/product-p/mro-sikv2airgnd-mr.htm>`__ (mRobotics)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:43
#: 1b75be77179747609ccf4c7d3fd76feb
msgid "`Holybro SiK Telemetry Radio <https://holybro.com/products/sik-telemetry-radio-v3>`__ (Holybro)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:44
#: 2b7f7f79318241c0a6619be64b5f15bd
msgid "`Holybro Sik Long Range <https://holybro.com/collections/telemetry-radios/products/sik-telemetry-radio-1w>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:48
#: b09ef00bc20f4a1a824a8befcc78aecd
msgid "If you're looking for an alternative, the :ref:`RFD900 Radio Modem <common-rfd900>` is highly recommended by many community members (The SiK platform was based on the RFD900 and both platforms have continued to evolve). It provides a significantly better range."
msgstr ""

